# Gems mise installs into every Ruby it installs (its ruby.default_packages_file).
#
# They run under each project's own Ruby (mise picks it from .ruby-version), so they
# have to exist in every version: Claude Code's ruby-lsp plugin, Neovim's ruby_lsp and
# rubocop servers, and conform's erb-format fail in a project whose Ruby lacks them.
dotenvcrypt
erb-formatter
ruby-lsp
rubocop
